## Context
Audit C4 (`docs/2026-09-24-rules-coherence-audit.md`). livre `.claude/skills/index-source/` duplicates the harness
skill under the same name; bodies differ only in the script path. It will
drift. Vendoring may be deliberate: a cloud session has no `~/.claude`.

## Decision needed
Recommended: keep the vendored copy only if cloud use matters, and add a
drift check against the harness copy; otherwise delete it. Renaming is the
third option if the fork is meant to diverge.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] Author decision logged here
- [ ] Either one copy remains, or the duplicate is drift-checked
